     TTYPE2  = 'STOP    '           / upper GTI boundary                             TFORM2  = 'D       '           / data format of field: 8-byte DOUBLE            TUNIT2  = 's       '           / physical unit of field                         EXTNAME = 'SRC_GTIS'           / The name of this table                         HDUCLASS= 'OGIP    '           / format conforms to OGIP standard               HDUCLAS1= 'GTI     '           / table contains Good Time Intervals             HDUCLAS2= 'STANDARD'           / standard Good Time Interval table              ONTIME  = 1.37900000000000E+05 / [s] sum of all Good Time Intervals             TSTART  = 6.64003220884844E+08 / [s] Lower bound of first GTI                   TSTOP   = 6.64141370884844E+08 / [s] Uppler bound of last GTI                   TIMEUNIT= 's       '           / All times in s unless specified otherwise      TIMESYS = 'TT      '           / XMM time will be TT (Terrestial Time)          MJDREF  = 5.08140000000000E+04 / 1998-01-01T00:00:00 (TT) expressed in MJD      TIMEREF = 'LOCAL   '           / Reference location of photon arrival times     TASSIGN = 'SATELLITE'          / Location of time assignment                    TIMEZERO=                    0 / Clock correction (if not zero)                 CLOCKAPP=                    T / Clock correction applied?                      END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        